      "cooked": "<p>What is the use case here?<br>\nFirst things first, you should only register with the details you want. We discourage dummy details.</p>\n<p>Secondly, you can always register again with new details.</p>\n<p>If you have already made a purchase for API credits under old account, share the Invoice with details of the Old and New accounts with api-support@indiacompliance.app and we will transfer the purchase to the New account.</p>",
